**实施**：
-', '{"kind": "episode", "scope": "global", "status": "testing", "confidence": 0.8, "source": "agent", "provenance": {"channel": "dsh", "session_kind": "agent"}, "payload": {"tags": ["自进化", "验证门", "回测腿", "Phase3", "RFC005"], "namespace": "decision"}, "body": "2026-08-25 验证门回测腿接入完成（自进化 Phase 3 最后一块）\n\n**实施**：\n- strategy plugin 修复：strategy_execute backtest 模式新增 start_date/end_date/initial_capital 参数（原硬编码空串导致验证门无法指定窗口）\n- evolver plugin 回测腿：judgeCandidates 增加第一级门（回测腿），策略类 candidate 先过三窗口回测（熊/震荡/牛，复用 M3-2 窗口），夏普<0.5 或回撤<-15% 当场 rejected（省 5 天观察期）；提示词类跳过直接进观察门\n- CandidateRecord 扩展：mutation_type/strategy_id/params_override/backtest_verdict 为 P4 元学习埋数据地基\n- 验收文档：docs/work-logs/2026-08/backtest-leg-acceptance.md（待 g10 明天裁决或首个策略 candidate 验证端到端）\n\n**意义**：\n- 进化周期从\"5 天观察期\"压缩到\"分钟级初筛 + 达标者 5 天\"——垃圾想法当场枪毙，P4 元学习的周期样本积累速度解锁\n- 两级门：回测腿（策略类）+ 模拟盘观察门（所有类型），提示词语义类无法回测故跳过第一级\n\n**RFC 005 进度更新**：Phase 3 提示词进化闭环 ~80% → **~95%**（回测腿接入 ✅，剩余：规则级验证门闭环 + RFC 008 文档更新）\n\n**前置**：M3-2 回测矩阵验收通过（4 组合夏普>1）+ W1 数据回填完成（394 根 K 线）+ 后端 DI 全链路修复"}', 'data', '{global,kind:episode,migration:quantsys-v2,orig_id:186}', NULL, '''-08'':2A,37B ''-15'':79B ''-2'':74B,144B ''-25'':3A,38B ''0.5'':77B ''0.8'':17B ''005'':127B ''008'':138B ''1'':148B ''2026'':1A,36B ''3'':7A,42B,130B ''394'':151B ''4'':146B ''5'':83B,107B,112B ''80'':132B ''95'':133B ''agent'':19B,25B ''backtest'':53B ''body'':35B ''candidate'':67B,100B ''candidaterecord'':87B ''channel'':21B ''confidence'':16B ''date/end_date/initial_capital'':56B ''decision'':34B ''di'':156B ''docs/work-logs/2026-08/backtest-leg-acceptance.md'':96B ''dsh'':22B ''episode'':11B ''evolver'':60B ''execute'':52B ''g10'':98B ''global'':13B ''judgecandidates'':63B ''k'':153B ''kind'':10B,24B ''m3'':73B,143B ''mutation'':89B ''n'':44B,45B,47B,59B,86B,94B,102B,103B,105B,117B,124B,125B,140B,141B ''namespace'':33B ''p4'':92B,115B ''payload'':26B ''phase'':6A,41B,129B ''phase3'':31B ''plugin'':49B,61B ''provenance'':20B ''rejected'':81B ''rfc'':126B,137B ''rfc005''