INSERT INTO public.memories (id, title, content, category, tags, agent_id, search_vector, created_at, updated_at, metadata) VALUES ('15721a38-5610-460b-b828-9059e0e362b2', '2026-09-08 02:2x 诊断：agent_virtual 账户自动化 7 条（fin-ag', '2026-09-08 02:2x 诊断：agent_virtual 账户自动化 7 条（fin-agent，webhook→http://localhost:3002/api/webhook/agent-os/trigger）100% failed、error 空。根因=agent-ts :3002 webhook 接收契约错位：Agent OS 按 WP-15 发送体 POST {job_id, job_name, trigger_time, metadata:{...task.Payload, run_id, owner, triggered_by}}（buildWebhookPayload agent-os/internal/kernel/scheduler/executor.go L250-265；任务 payload 已含 kind:agent_turn + message + 部分 agentKind，注册完整），而 agent-ts handler（agent-ts/src/api/webhook/agent-os-trigger.ts L39 payload.payload.agentKind）期望 agent_turn 旧契约顶层 {task_id,task_name,execution_id,payload:{...}} → 顶层无 payload 键 → undefined.agentKind TypeError → 每次 500 {''success'':false,''error'':"Cannot read properties of undefined (reading ''agentKind'')"} → Agent OS 记 failed。morning 9/7 09:00 起 1 次、realtime 12 次(09:00-14:30/30m)、daily 2 次、weekly 各 1 次全败。agent-ts 内另有 webhook-server.ts /api/agent/trigger({task,prompt}) 与 agent-os-executor.ts(TaskExecutor) 两套同型旧契约未挂实际路径。修复建议（单文件 agent-os-trigger.ts 对齐 WP-15：读 body.job_id/job_name + metadata.message/agentKind，回 2xx 即 Agent OS run success；删/容错 updateExecution(execution_id) 旧回执），重启 agent-ts :3002 生效；验证=POST WP-15 形状体看 2xx。跨子项目改动+重启 :3002 待用户确认。', 'knowledge', '{agent_virtual,automation,fin-agent,webhook,WP-15,agent-os-trigger,契约错位,诊断,2026-09-08,w-752decf5}', NULL, '''-08'':3A,17B ''-09'':2A,16B ''-14'':135B ''-15'':47B,161B,190B ''-265'':69B ''/agentkind'':167B ''/api/agent/trigger'':149B ''/internal/kernel/scheduler/executor.go'':67B ''/src/api/webhook/agent-os-trigger.ts'':88B ''00'':126B,134B ''02'':4A,18B ''09'':125B,133B ''1'':128B,142B ''100'':32B ''12'':131B ''2'':138B ''2026'':1A,15B ''2x'':5A,19B ''2xx'':169B,192B ''30/30m'':136B ''3002'':40B,185B,195B ''3002/api/webhook/agent-os/trigger'':31B ''500'':108B ''7'':10A,24B ''9/7'