INSERT INTO public.memories (id, title, content, category, tags, agent_id, search_vector, created_at, updated_at, metadata) VALUES ('7ae894b3-949a-4140-b178-2fa8e416b044', 'RFC 011 Phase 1 实施完成（w-5b8aac2a，2026-09-08）

## 完成', 'RFC 011 Phase 1 实施完成（w-5b8aac2a，2026-09-08）

## 完成内容

### 1. Domain 层（新建）
- `domain/watch/models.py`: TriggerLevel(L0/L1/L2)、ActionHint、EscalationPolicy、WatchRule、RuleHealthReport
- `domain/watch/ports.py`: IWatchRuleRepository、ITriggerHistoryRepository、IQuoteProvider
- `domain/watch/services/escalation_checker.py`: 5类升级条件（触发频率/价格偏差/核心区域/量能异常/多规则共振）
- `domain/watch/services/rule_health_checker.py`: 规则健康度检查（HEALTHY/EXPIRED/STALE/OUTDATED/INACTIVE）

### 2. 数据库扩展
- `ALTER TABLE watch_rules ADD COLUMN escalation_policy JSONB`
- `ALTER TABLE watch_rules ADD COLUMN action_hint JSONB`
- 41条规则补默认有效期30天

### 3. Application 层
- `application/services/watch_engine/dto.py`: TriggerPayload DTO
- `application/services/watch_engine/notifier.py`: 改造为调用 NotificationFacade（禁止直接调用飞书SDK）
- `application/notification/notification_facade.py`: 扩展 send_watch_triggered 支持 trigger_level/action_hint/escalation_reason/decision_audit_id

### 4. 引擎集成
- `application/services/watch_engine/engine.py`: 集成 EscalationChecker，L0/L1触发时自动检查升级条件
- `application/services/watch_engine/factory.py`: 移除 agent_service/feishu_service 注入

### 5. 规则批量标注
- L2: 16条（agent模式+止损止盈）
- L1: 20条（观察监控）
- L0: 3条（无context）
- 全部50条规则配置默认 escalation_policy

### 6. 架构治理
- `pi-investment/CLAUDE.md`: 新增 Architecture Rules (Mandatory) 章节
- `agent-dh/CLAUDE.md`: 新增 Architecture Rules (Mandatory) 章节

## 关键设计决策
- 复用现有 decision_audit 表保存AI决策（不新建表）
- 升级条件保守化（频率≥3次/10分钟、偏差>5%、量比>阈值×2）
- L2强制走agent模式（即使notify_mode=direct）

## 待完成
- Phase 2: 规则生命周期管理（定时任务+僵尸规则清理+飞书通知）
- Phase 3: 前端交互（可选）

## 参考
- 方案文档: docs/rfcs/011-watch-engine-tiered-notification.md', 'knowledge', '{RFC011,WatchEngine,分层提醒,架构治理,w-5b8aac2a}', NULL, '''-08'':11A,23B ''-09'':10A,22B ''/claude.md'':121B,130B ''011'':2A,14B ''1'':4A,16B,25B ''16条'':104B ''2'':50B,150B,157B ''2026'':9A,21B ''20条'':108B ''3'':71B,163B ''3条'':111B ''3次/10'':144B ''4'':89B ''41条规则补默认有效期30天'':70B ''5'':101B,147B ''5b8aac2a'':8A,20B ''5类升级条件'':41B ''6'':116B ''action'':67B ''actionhint'':32B ''add'':56B,65B ''agent'':98B,128B ''agent-dh'':127B ''agent模式'':105B ''alter'':52B,61B ''application'':72B ''application/notification/notification_facade.py'':81B ''application/services/watch_engine/dto.py'':74B ''application/services/watch_engine/engine.py'':91B ''application/services/watch_engine/factory.py'':96B ''application/services/watch_engine/notifier.py'':77B ''architecture'':123B,132B ''audit'':139B ''column'':57B,66B ''decision'':138B ''dh'':129B ''direct'':154B ''docs/rfcs/011-watch-engine-tiered-notification.md'':168B ''domain'':26B ''domain/watch/models.py'':29B ''domain/watch/ports.py'':36B ''domain/watch/services/escalation_checker.py'':40B ''domain/watch/services/rule_health_checker.py'':47B ''dto'':76B ''escalation'':58B,114B ''escalationchecker'':93B ''escalationpolicy'':33B ''healthy/expired/stale/outdated/inactive'':49B ''hint'':68B ''investment'':120B ''iquoteprovider'':39B ''itriggerhistoryrepository'':38B ''iwatchrulerepository'':37B ''jsonb'':60B,69B ''l0'':110B ''l0/l1'':94B ''l0/l1/l2'':31B ''l1'':107B ''l2'':103B ''l2强制走agent模式'':151B ''level/action_hint/escalation_reason/decision_audit_id'':88B ''mandatory'':125B,134B ''mode'':153B ''notificationfacade'':79B ''phase'':3A,15B,156B,162B ''pi'':119B ''pi-investment'':118B ''policy'':59B,115B ''rfc'':1A,13B ''rulehealthreport'':35B ''rules'':55B,64B,124B,133B ''send'':83B ''service/feishu_service'':99B ''table'':53B,62B ''trigger'':87B ''triggered'':85B ''triggerlevel'':30B ''triggerpayload'':75B ''w'':7A,19B ''w-5b8aac2a'':6A,18B ''watch'':54B,63B,84B