② OOM 实锤：~/.dsh-agent-dh/profiles/investment/state/restart-1788981563958.log(Sep 9 19:19, pid 60553) 与 restart-1789051901380.log(Sep 10 14:51→pid 17499 跑 8745s) 均为 "FATAL ERROR: Reached heap limit"，GC 在 4034-4041/4144MB 处 allocation failure → 当时是 V8 默认堆上限 4144MB；现已显式 --max-old-space-size=8192（ps eww 实测 13080/13081 均 8192）。
③ 启动期错误风暴已消失：launchd.err.log 共 7767 行，ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND 442 次 + failed to import loader entry 442 次，最后一条在 7752 行；7766 行是 PID 30321 启动标记 → awk NR>7766 命中 0 条，日志 mtime 停在 18:00:47（3.5h 无新写入）。quantsys-v2-client 解析问题已由 dist 优先 + 新增 "source": "./src/index.ts" 条件修复（dist/index.mjs 19:22 重建；此改动由其他窗口落地，先前把 main 指向 src 的改法已被取代）。
④ 残余风险：(a) :13081(agent-dh profile, PID 50686，当前会话所在实例) 无看门狗——plist 写死 DSH_PORT=13080 + LABEL=com.pi-investment.dsh，launchctl 域内只有 13080 作业；13081 启动 3 分钟已 700MB，堆上限同为 8192MB，失控无人拦（其未托管 launchd，脚本判定"通道不可用"会拒绝 kill，只告警，安全）。(b) 堆上限翻倍是抬高天花板不是修漏，防线靠 10 分钟一采样的看门狗；实测失控末段 ~1GB/10min，6144→8192MB 仅约 20 分钟窗口，余量薄。(c) 增长为"台阶式"非纯泄漏（多段 6.7h/4h 长平台说明有 GC 回收，但台阶后不回落），代码层根因仍未定位。
⑤ 事件队列：内存事件已不在 open 队列（仅剩一条无关的 v2 DB idle-in-transaction），维持 resolved，无需重开。', 'experience', '{dsh,内存,OOM,heap-watch,13080,13081,根因复盘}', NULL, '''-09'':4A,15B ''-12'':5A,16B ''-3.1'':88B ''-4041'':125B ''/.dsh-agent-dh/profiles/investment/state/restart-1788981563958.log'':99B ''/2795'':53B ''/4144mb'':126B ''/src/index.ts'':197B ''0'':177B ''00'':183B ''10'':109B,250B ''10min'':61B ''13080'':9A,20B,224B,229B ''13080/13081'':144B ''13081'':211B,231B ''14'':110B ''16.6'':47B ''17499'':113B ''18'':182B ''19'':6A,17B,79B,102B,103B,200B ''1gb'':63B ''1gb/10min'':253B ''2.0'':87B ''20'':257B ''2026'':3A,14B ''2036'':45B ''2168'':73B ''22'':201B ''24'':54B ''256'':39B ''2726'':50B ''27960'':57B ''2805mb'':46B ''3'':233B ''3.5'':185B ''30321'':76B,171B ''31'':7A,18B ''350'':77B ''372'':58B ''37735'':68B ''379mb'':82B ''3880mb'':74B ''393mb'':25B ''395/396/392'':84B ''396mb'':78B ''3h05m'':33B ''40'':51B ''4034'':124B ''4144mb'':133B ''442'':156B,163B ''4450'':44B ''47'':184B ''4880'':69B ''50686'':217B ''51'':111B ''54329'':72B ''5538mb'':70B ''6.2'':93B ''6.4'':31B ''6.7'':265B ''600s'':38B ''60553'':105B ''6144'':254B ''6144mb'':29B ''6181mb'':59B ''700mb'':235B ''7752'':166B ''7766'':168B,175B ''7767'':150B ''8192'':140B,146B ''8192mb'':27B,237B,255B ''85'':91B ''8745s'':115B ''9'':101B ''94'':96B ''a'':210B ''agent'':213B ''agent-dh'':212B ''allocation'':128B ''auto'':65B ''awk'':173B ''b'':247B ''c'':260B ''client'':191B ''com.pi-investment.dsh'':226B ''db'':278B ''dh'':214B ''dist'':193B ''dist/index.mjs'':199B ''dsh'':1A,12B,222B ''dsh-heap-watch.log'':36B ''entry'':162B ''err'':152B ''error'':118B ''eww'':142B ''failed'':158B ''failure'':129B ''fatal'':117B ''found'':155B ''gb'':89B,94B ''gc'':122B,268B ''h'':48B,186B ''h/4h'':266B ''heap'':120B ''idle'':280B ''idle-in-transaction'':279B ''import'':160B ''in'':281B ''kill'':244B ''label'':225B ''launchctl'':227B ''launchd'':240B ''launchd.err.log'':148B ''limit'':121B ''loader'':161B ''main'':205B ''max'':136B ''max-