结果：profit
教训：2026-09-13 首个稳健正向结果：不选股、只调暴露的**风控叠层**有效。口径：800 只最活跃标的（2024H1 定义）等权 core，2024-07~2026-09（537 交易日，含成本）：基线 CAGR +22.7%/DD -17.9%/Sharpe 0.98；加"波动率目标化（月度调整）= +18.0%/-14.2%/1.04；回撤闸门（-10% 减半仓、-5% 恢复）= +21.0%/-13.0%/1.04；**两者叠加 = +18.0%/-10.6%/Sharpe 1.22**。稳健性：9 组参数组合（target_vol 12/15/20% × dd_trigger 8/10/12%）Sharpe 全部 1.03~1.34 > 基线 0.98；池子 300/800/1500 只结果一致。含义：**用约 5pp 的收益换取回撤减半 + Sharpe +24%**；且因不选股，几乎没有过拟合面。局限：窗口仅 14 个月且是多头市，不可外推；叠层不创造收益，只改善风险调整后表现。', 'experience', '{SYSTEM,profit}', NULL, '''+18.0'':57B,69B ''+21.0'':65B ''+22.7'':49B ''+24'':96B ''-07'':42B ''-09'':11B,27B ''-10'':61B ''-10.6'':70B ''-13'':12B,28B ''-13.0'':66B ''-14.2'':58B ''-17.9'':51B ''-5'':63B ''/1.04'':59B,67B ''/dd'':50B ''/sharpe'':52B,71B ''0.98'':53B,87B ''1.03'':84B ''1.22'':72B ''12/15/20'':78B ''13'':14B ''14'':101B ''17.749'':15B ''2024'':41B ''2024h1'':37B ''2026'':10B,26B ''300/800/1500'':89B ''537'':44B ''5pp'':93B ''8/10/12'':81B ''800'':35B ''9'':74B ''cagr'':48B ''core'':4A,19B,40B ''dd'':79B ''profit'':2A,24B ''sharpe'':82B,95B ''system'':1A,8B ''t05'':13B ''target'':76B ''trigger'':80B ''vol'':77B ''z'':16B ''~1.34'':85B ''~2026-09'':43B ''不可外推'':103B ''不选股'':30B ''且因不选股'':97B ''两者叠加'':68B ''个月且是多头市'':102B ''交易日'':45B ''交易经验'':9B ''全部'':83B ''减半仓'':62B ''几乎没有过拟合面'':98B ''加'':54B ''叠层不创造收益'':104B ''口径'':34B ''只改善风险调整后表现'':105B ''只最活跃标的'':36B ''只结果一致'':90B ''只调暴露的'':31B ''含义'':91B ''含成本'':46B ''回撤闸门'':7A,22B,60B ''场景'':17B ''基线'':47B,86B ''定义'':38B ''局限'':99B ''恢复'':64B ''教训'':25B ''月度调整'':56B ''有效'':33B ''池子'':88B ''波动率目标化'':55B ''波动目标'':6A,21B ''用约'':92B ''的收益换取回撤减半'':94B ''稳健性'':73B ''窗口仅'':100B ''等权'':3A,18B,39B ''组参数组合'':75B ''结果'':23B ''风控叠层'':5A,20B,32B ''首个稳健正向结果'':29B', '2026-09-13 13:13:17.751166', '2026-09-13 13:13:17.751166', '{}');
INSERT INTO public.memories (id, title, content, category, tags, agent_id, search_vector, created_at, updated_at, metadata) VALUES ('c17dfd40-8946-4bad-b69d-392f1973b8c7', '【重复派单根因修复 · solve-kit 前置终态复核 · 2026-09-13 w-32314d', '【重复派单根因修复 · solve-kit 前置终态复核 · 2026-09-13 w-32314d00】背景：同一根因（策略接口 500）在错误台账里裂成 6 张卡并被我连续收到 4 次派单，其中两条到达时事件早已 resolved——派单边界缺复核。定位：packages/solve-kit/src/host.ts::createSolveHandler 直接拿客户端传来的卡片快照组装消息，从不查事件当前状态（卡片可能是旧快照或已被他人闭环）。修复：复用包内既有 fetchEventStatus()，在解析目标会话前加前置复核——resolved/ignored 直接拒单（提示旧快照、如需重开先点「复开」），查不到/异常放行（fail-open）。验证：packages/pages/execution/tests/solve-predispatch-guard.test.ts 5 passed + 包内全量 35 passed + tsc --noEmit 干净。注意：solve-kit 的 main 指向 src，但运行中的 DSH 进程已装载旧模块，护栏需实例重启后生效（重启会中断当前会话）。附带教训：看板/派单类功能必须区分「端点新建/需刷新的插件」与「需要重启才生效的 host 侧插件」——本轮 quantsys-v2 侧改动靠 launchctl kickstart 生效，agent-dh 侧的 server 插件同理需重启实例。', 'knowledge', '{solve-kit,duplicate-dispatch,guardrail,w-32314d00}', NULL, '''-09'':7A,18B ''-13'':8A,19B ''2026'':6A,17B ''32314d'':11A ''32314d00'':22B ''35'':60B ''4'':30B ''5'':57B ''500'':26B ''6'':28B ''agent'':96B ''agent-dh'':95B ''createsolvehandler'':37B ''dh'':97B ''dsh'':74B ''fail'':53B ''fail-open'':52B ''fetcheventstatus'':43B ''host'':85B ''kickstart'':93B ''kit'':4A,15B,68B ''launchctl'':92B ''main'':70B ''noemit'':63B ''open'':54B ''packages/pages/execution/tests/solve-predispatch-guard.test.ts'':56B ''packages/solve-kit/src/host.ts'':36B ''passed'':58B,61B ''quantsys'':89B ''quantsys-v2'':88B ''resolved'':33B ''resolved/ignored'':45B ''server'':99B ''solve'':3A,14B,67B ''solve-kit'':2A,13B,66B ''src'':72B ''tsc'':62B ''v2'':90B ''w'':10A,21B ''w-32314d'':9A ''w-32314d00'':20B ''与'':83B ''从不查事件当前状态'':39B ''但运行中的'':73B ''侧插件'':86B ''侧改动靠'':91B ''侧的'':98B ''修复'':41B ''其中两条到达时事件早已'':32B ''前置终态复核'':5A,16B ''包内全量'':59B ''卡片可能是旧快照或已被他人闭环'':40B ''同一根因'':24B ''在解析目标会话前加前置复核'':44B ''在错误台账里裂成'':27B ''复开'':49B ''复用包内既有'':42B ''如需重开先点'':48B ''定位'':35B ''干净'':64B ''异常放行'':51B ''张卡并被我连续收到'':29B ''护栏需实例重启后生效'':76B ''指向'':71B ''提示旧快照'':47B ''插件同理需重启实例'':100B ''本轮'':87B ''查不到'':50B ''次派单'':31B ''注意'':65B ''派单类功能必须区分'':80B ''派单边界缺复核'':34B ''生效'':94B ''的'':69B ''直接拒单'':46B ''直接拿客户端传来的卡片快照组装消息'':38B ''看板'':79B ''端点新建'':81B ''策略接口'':25B ''背景'':23B ''进程已装载旧模块'':75B ''重启会中断当前会话'':77B ''重复派单根因修复'':1A,12B ''附带教训'':78B ''需刷新的插件'':82B ''需要重启才生效的'':84B ''验证'':55B', '2026-09-13 13:40:13.296068', '2026-09-13 13:40:13.296068', '{}');
INSERT INTO public.memories (id, title, content, category, tags, agent_id, search_vector, created_at, updated_at, metadata) VALUES ('b89487b8-eda3-45e9-b8d3-ccb65f7f2242', '【事件 c0e69791 处置 + 可见性机制去噪 · 2026-09-13 w-32314d00】', '【事件 c0e69791 处置 + 可见性机制去噪 · 2026-09-13 w-32314d00】现象：error_events 出现 inprocess_job_orphan_reaped（logger=daily_jobs_bootstrap，level=error）。根因=**本窗口自己新增的可见性机制制造的事件**：为治理「僵死在 running 的任务永久隐形」而加的宿主启动孤儿判死 _reap_orphan_runs 首版按行打 ERROR → 被日志采集器收成 error_events，每次实例重启只要有孤儿行就生成一张待人工闭环的卡。孤儿本身真实且已正确处理（inprocess_job_runs 行落 failed + 原因，可被 _job_failure_watch 巡检）。动作=判死日志改为一条聚合 warning（count + jobs 明细），事故记录保留在 run 行；补回归测试锁日志级别。验证=13:41:03 重启对合成孤儿行 zz-orphan-probe 实测：唯一一条 level=warning 的 inprocess_job_orphans_reaped（含 jobs 明细），同刻 error_events 新增 orphan 类 0 条，孤儿行同毫秒落 failed；pytest tests/test_false_success_guard.py 16 passed。教训=「可见性机制自身也会制造噪声」——凡是“已发现并处理完成”的状态，日志级别应为 warning 并聚合，error 级要留给“需要人来做点什么”的信号；否则监控看板会被自噪声淹没。', 'knowledge', '{error-event,c0e69791,orphan-running,log-noise,w-32314d00}', NULL, '''-09'':6A,16B ''-13'':7A,17B ''0'':100B ''03'':76B ''13'':74B ''16'':106B ''2026'':5A,15B ''32314d00'':10A,20B ''41'':75B ''bootstrap'':32B ''c0e69791'':2A,12B ''count'':66B ''daily'':30B ''error'':22B,34B,46B,48B,95B,116B ''events'':23B,49B,96B ''failed'':56B,103B ''failure'':60B ''inprocess'':25B,52B,87B ''job'':26B,53B,59B,88B ''jobs'':31B,67B,92B ''level'':33B,84B ''logger'':29B ''orphan'':27B,43B,80B,98B ''orphans'':89B ''passed'':107B ''probe'':81B ''pytest'':104B ''reap'':42B ''reaped'':28B,90B ''run'':70B ''running'':39B ''runs'':44B,54B ''tests/test_false_success_guard.py'':105B ''w'':9A,19B ''w-32314d00'':8A,18B ''warning'':65B,85B,114B ''watch'':61B ''zz'':79B ''zz-orphan-probe'':78B ''为治理'':37B ''事件'':1A,11B ''事故记录保留在'':69B ''僵死在'':38B ''凡是'':110B ''出现'':24B ''判死日志改为一条聚合'':64B ''动作'':63B ''原因'':57B ''可被'':58B ''可见性机制去噪'':4A,14B ''可见性机制自身也会制造噪声'':109B ''同刻'':94B ''否则监控看板会被自噪声淹没'':120B ''含'':91B ''唯一一条'':83B ''处置'':3A,13B ''孤儿本身真实且已正确处理'':51B ''孤儿行同毫秒落'':102B ''实测'':82B ''巡检'':62B ''已发现并处理完成'':111B ''并聚合'':115B ''教训'':108B ''新增'':97B ''日志级别应为'':113B ''明细'':68B,93B ''本窗口自己新增的可见性机制制造的事件'':36B ''条'':101B ''根因'':35B ''每次实例重启只要有孤儿行就生成一张待人工闭环的卡'':50B ''现象'':21B ''的'':86B ''的任务永久隐形'':40B ''的信号'':119B ''的状态'':112B ''类'':99B ''级要留给'':117B ''而加的宿主启动孤儿判死'':41B ''行'':71B ''行落'':55B ''补回归测试锁日志级别'':72B ''被日志采集器收成'':47B ''重启对合成孤儿行'':77B ''需要人来做点什么'':118B ''首版按行打'':45B ''验证'':73B', '2026-09-13 13:41:57.300095', '2026-09-13 13:41:57.300095', '{}');
INSERT INTO public.memories (id, title, content, category, tags, agent_id, search_vector, created_at, updated_at, metadata) VALUES ('efe65a76-c929-49a4-9ebb-dfa8f2d7d882', '【事件 222154a8 处置 · 2026-09-13 w-32314d00】akshare ge', '【事件 222154a8 处置 · 2026-09-13 w-32314d00】akshare get_index_daily failed: Failed to resolve finance.sina.com.cn。根因=环境（机器级 DNS 抖动：同一分钟 qt.gtimg.cn 也解析失败）+ 代码缺口（MarketDataService.get_index_history 只有外网一条路，从不读本地 quant.index_daily）→ 一次 DNS 抖动让「基准指数」整段不可用（基准指数获取失败: 暂无指数 sh000300 的历史数据），而库里 000300.SH 数据完好。动作=加 DB-first（符号经 utils.symbol_classifier.resolve_index_symbol 规范化 sh000300→000300.SH；本地有数直接返回 source=db:quant.index_daily；无数据/非指数/读库异常回退 provider）；契约对齐（返回键与 provider 一致；amount=0 视为源未提供→不输出该键）；重启 v2-api。证据=线上直取 get_index_history(sh000300,2026-08-26,2026-09-11) → success、total=13、0.05s、09-11 收盘 4510.155；错误串全日志仅 1 次（11:00）此后 0 次；DNS 已恢复；accounts API 200/0.12s；新增 tests/test_index_history_db_first.py 7 passed（含"DB 有数不得打外网"绊线）。通用教训=**能用本地库回答的问题不要依赖外网**：外网抖动会以"数据不存在"的形态伪装成业务缺失；取数路径应 DB-first + provider 兜底，并在返回值里标注 source 便于溯源（R-013）。', 'knowledge', '{error-event,222154a8,index-daily,db-first,dns,w-32314d00}', NULL, '''-013'':148B ''-08'':98B ''-09'':5A,16B,101B ''-11'':102B,109B ''-13'':6A,17B ''-26'':99B ''0'':84B,118B ''0.05'':106B ''00'':116B ''000300.sh'':56B,69B ''09'':108B ''1'':113B ''11'':115B ''13'':105B ''200/0.12s'':124B ''2026'':4A,15B,97B,100B ''222154a8'':2A,13B ''32314d00'':9A,20B ''4510.155'':111B ''7'':127B ''accounts'':122B ''akshare'':10A,21B ''amount'':83B ''api'':90B,123B ''daily'':24B,45B,74B ''db'':61B,72B,130B,140B ''db-first'':60B,139B ''dns'':33B,47B,120B ''failed'':25B,26B ''finance.sina.com.cn'':29B ''first'':62B,141B ''ge'':11A ''get'':22B,93B ''history'':41B,95B ''index'':23B,40B,65B,94B ''marketdataservice.get'':39B ''passed'':128B ''provider'':78B,81B,142B ''qt.gtimg.cn'':36B ''quant.index'':44B,73B ''r'':147B ''resolve'':28B ''s'':107B ''sh000300'':53B,68B,96B ''source'':71B,145B ''success'':103B ''symbol'':66B ''tests/test_index_history_db_first.py'':126B ''to'':27B ''total'':104B ''utils.symbol_classifier.resolve'':64B ''v2'':89B ''v2-api'':88B ''w'':8A,19B ''w-32314d00'':7A,18B ''一次'':46B ''一致'':82B ''不输出该键'':86B ''也解析失败'':37B ''事件'':1A,12B ''从不读本地'':43B ''代码缺口'':38B ''便于溯源'':146B ''兜底'':143B ''加'':59B ''动作'':58B ''取数路径应'':138B ''只有外网一条路'':42B ''同一分钟'':35B ''含'':129B ''基准指数'':49B ''基准指数获取失败'':51B ''处置'':3A,14B ''外网抖动会以'':135B ''契约对齐'':79B ''已恢复'':121B ''并在返回值里标注'':144B ''抖动'':34B ''抖动让'':48B ''收盘'':110B ''数据不存在'':136B ''数据完好'':57B ''整段不可用'':50B ''新增'':125B ''无数据'':75B ''暂无指数'':52B ''有数不得打外网'':131B ''本地有数直接返回'':70B ''机器级'':32B ''根因'':30B ''次'':114B,119B ''此后'':117B ''环境'':31B ''的历史数据'':54B ''的形态伪装成业务缺失'':137B ''符号经'':63B ''线上直取'':92B ''绊线'':132B ''而库里'':55B ''能用本地库回答的问题不要依赖外网'':134B ''规范化'':67B ''视为源未提供'':85B ''证据'':91B ''读库异常回退'':77B ''返回键与'':80B ''通用教训'':133B ''重启'':87B ''错误串全日志仅'':112B ''非指数'':76B', '2026-09-13 13:44:58.317703', '2026-09-13 13:44:58.317703', '{}');
INSERT INTO public.memories (id, title, content, category, tags, agent_id, search_vector, created_at, updated_at, metadata) VALUES ('12d31871-cf91-4b51-9557-36aaa5fd019e', '【事件 a6780ec3 处置 · 2026-09-13 w-32314d00】session_le', '【事件 a6780ec3 处置 · 2026-09-13 w-32314d00】session_leak_detected（48 次，thread=scheduler/asyncio/pooled）。机制：SQLAlchemy 读操作隐式 autobegin 事务；线程读完转做长时间非 DB 工作（数百次网络抓取/模型训练）或池化线程归还池中，线程本地 scoped session 仍 in_transaction()==True → 占住连接池坑位（idle in transaction）→ guard 5 分钟后判泄漏并 rollback+close 止血；39 条 ERROR 的 age 全在 311~359s（刚过阈值）。审计出四处主要持有者：①opportunity_scoring_service._score_single_stock→stock_repository.get_by_symbol（10+ 池化线程，最多）；②data_jobs._run→stock_repository.get_all（asyncio.to_thread）；③scheduler_tasks.handle_model_train_auto→_check_train_needed（单点释放覆盖不到早退分支）；④daily_jobs_bootstrap._job_financial_statements→financial_statement_update_job.execute（最后一次 09-12 23:06:41 age=359，读宇宙开事务后跑 12 小时）。修复=四处补「用完即归还 close_session()」（评分 worker finally、data_jobs 外层读后、训练 try/finally、财报 job 宇宙解析后+收尾，含早退分支）。验证=线程内实测 job 跑完 session.in_transaction()=False 且 guard 注册表存活 0；该串 09-13 全天 0 次；tests/test_session_release.py 3 passed。通用纪律=任何「读一下再干很久」的线程路径读完必须归还线程会话，池化线程尤其如此；guard 是兜底不改。', 'knowledge', '{error-event,a6780ec3,session-leak,idle-in-transaction,w-32314d00}', NULL, '''-09'':5A,16B ''-12'':95B ''-13'':6A,17B,135B ''0'':132B,137B ''06'':97B ''09'':94B,134B ''10'':72B ''12'':102B ''2026'':4A,15B ''23'':96B ''3'':140B ''311'':62B ''32314d00'':9A,20B ''359'':100B ''39'':56B ''41'':98B ''48'':24B ''5'':51B ''a6780ec3'':2A,13B ''age'':60B,99B ''all'':78B ''asyncio.to'':79B ''auto'':84B ''autobegin'':31B ''bootstrap._job_financial_statements'':91B ''by'':70B ''check'':85B ''close'':54B,107B ''daily'':89B ''data'':75B,112B ''db'':34B ''detected'':23B ''error'':58B ''false'':128B ''finally'':111B ''financial_statement_update_job.execute'':92B ''guard'':50B,130B,147B ''idle'':47B ''in'':43B,48B ''job'':118B,124B ''jobs'':90B,113B ''jobs._run'':76B ''le'':11A ''leak'':22B ''model'':82B ''needed'':87B ''opportunity'':66B ''passed'':141B ''rollback'':53B ''scheduler/asyncio/pooled'':27B ''scheduler_tasks.handle'':81B ''scoped'':40B ''scoring'':67B ''service._score_single_stock'':68B ''session'':10A,21B,41B,108B ''session.in'':126B ''sqlalchemy'':29B ''stock_repository.get'':69B,77B ''symbol'':71B ''tests/test_session_release.py'':139B ''thread'':26B,80B ''train'':83B,86B ''transaction'':44B,49B,127B ''true'':45B ''try/finally'':116B ''w'':8A,19B ''w-32314d00'':7A,18B ''worker'':110B ''~359s'':63B ''且'':129B ''事件'':1A,12B ''事务'':32B ''仍'':42B ''任何'':143B ''修复'':104B ''全在'':61B ''全天'':136B ''分钟后判泄漏并'':52B ''刚过阈值'':64B ''单点释放覆盖不到早退分支'':88B ''占住连接池坑位'':46B ''含早退分支'':121B ''四处补'':105B ''处置'':3A,14B ''外层读后'':114B ''宇宙解析后'':119B ''审计出四处主要持有者'':65B ''小时'':103B ''工作'':35B ''或池化线程归还池中'':38B ''收尾'':120B ''数百次网络抓取'':36B ''是兜底不改'':148B ''最后一次'':93B ''最多'':74B ''机制'':28B ''条'':57B ''模型训练'':37B ''次'':25B,138B ''止血'':55B ''池化线程'':73B ''池化线程尤其如此'':146B ''注册表存活'':131B ''用完即归还'':106B ''的'':59B ''的线程路径读完必须归还线程会话'':145B ''线程内实测'':123B ''线程本地'':39B ''线程读完转做长时间非'':33B ''训练'':115B ''评分'':109B ''该串'':133B ''读一下再干很久'':144B ''读宇宙开事务后跑'':101B ''读操作隐式'':30B ''财报'':117B ''跑完'':125B ''通用纪律'':142B ''验证'':122B', '2026-09-13 13:50:34.679886', '2026-09-13 13:50:34.679886', '{}');
INSERT INTO public.memories (id, title, content, category, tags, agent_id, search_vector, created_at, updated_at, metadata) VALUES ('ff2083b4-54f4-45f9-bbb0-2c292f0d98a6', '【事件 21ee9ab6 更正处置 · 2026-09-13 w-32314d00】API 错误 c', '【事件 21ee9ab6 更正处置 · 2026-09-13 w-32314d00】API 错误 connection already closed（看板卡片），原始 traceback 揭示真因链：signal_tracking_repository.update_signal_performance:106 cursor.execute 抛psycopg2.OperationalError「terminating connection due to idle-in-transaction timeout」→ except 里对已死连接 rollback()→ InterfaceError「connection already closed」顶替原始异常 = 看板只见次生错误、真因不可见。两个缺陷：①读方法（get_signals_by_date/after_date/get_signals）不结束事务，而 repository 持长寿命裸连接（自建 psycopg2.connect）→ 空闲在事务中超过 PG idle_in_transaction_session_timeout 被杀；②错误处理不自愈（连接永不重建）。与今日 a6780ec3（session_leak_detected）同族：事务没结束→连接空闲占用，只是裸连接版。修复=①_end_read() 所有方法退出前结束事务；②_safe_rollback() 先记原始异常、不让次生异常顶替、丢弃死连接；③_ensure_connection() closed/None 时自愈重建。验证=tests/test_signal_tracking_connection.py 5 passed；重启后实测原失败端点 PUT /api/signals/track/update → 200/0.82s；「connection already closed」全日志仍 1 次（历史），重启后 0 次。卡片已 reopen→resolve 更正结论（note 1123 字）。纪律=裸连接同样要"用完即结束事务"；except 里先记原始异常再清理；连接对象要能检测 closed 并重建。', 'knowledge', '{error-event,21ee9ab6,idle-in-transaction,raw-connection,error-masking,w-32314d00}', NULL, '''-09'':5A,17B ''-13'':6A,18B ''/api/signals/track/update'':106B ''0'':116B ''1'':112B ''106'':34B ''1123'':123B ''200/0.82s'':107B ''2026'':4A,16B ''21ee9ab6'':2A,14B ''32314d00'':9A,21B ''5'':102B ''a6780ec3'':79B ''already'':25B,51B,109B ''api'':10A,22B ''by'':60B ''c'':12A ''closed'':26B,52B,110B,131B ''closed/none'':98B ''connection'':24B,38B,50B,97B,108B ''cursor.execute'':35B ''date/after_date/get_signals'':61B ''detected'':82B ''due'':39B ''end'':88B ''ensure'':96B ''except'':46B,128B ''get'':58B ''idle'':42B,70B ''idle-in-transaction'':41B ''in'':43B,71B ''interfaceerror'':49B ''leak'':81B ''note'':122B ''passed'':103B ''performance'':33B ''pg'':69B ''psycopg2.connect'':67B ''put'':105B ''read'':89B ''reopen'':119B ''repository'':64B ''resolve'':120B ''rollback'':48B,92B ''safe'':91B ''session'':73B,80B ''signal'':32B ''signal_tracking_repository.update'':31B ''signals'':59B ''terminating'':37B ''tests/test_signal_tracking_connection.py'':101B ''timeout'':45B,74B ''to'':40B ''traceback'':29B ''transaction'':44B,72B ''w'':8A,20B ''w-32314d00'':7A,19B ''不结束事务'':62B ''不让次生异常顶替'':94B ''与今日'':78B ''丢弃死连接'':95B ''两个缺陷'':56B ''事件'':1A,13B ''事务没结束'':84B ''修复'':87B ''先记原始异常'':93B ''全日志仍'':111B ''卡片已'':118B ''历史'':114B ''原始'':28B ''只是裸连接版'':86B ''同族'':83B ''字'':124B ''并重建'':132B ''所有方法退出前结束事务'':90B ''抛psycopg2.operationalerror'':36B ''持长寿命裸连接'':65B ''揭示真因链'':30B ''时自愈重建'':99B ''更正处置'':3A,15B ''更正结论'':121B ''次'':113B,117B ''用完即结束事务'':127B ''看板卡片'':27B ''看板只见次生错误'':54B ''真因不可见'':55B ''空闲在事务中超过'':68B ''纪律'':125B ''而'':63B ''自建'':66B ''被杀'':75B ''裸连接同样要'':126B ''读方法'':57B ''连接对象要能检测'':130B ''连接永不重建'':77B ''连接空闲占用'':85B ''里先记原始异常再清理'':129B ''里对已死连接'':47B ''重启后'':115B ''重启后实测原失败端点'':104B ''错误'':11A,23B ''错误处理不自愈'':76B ''顶替原始异常'':53B ''验证'':100B', '2026-09-13 14:34:06.296951', '2026-09-13 14:34:06.296951', '{}');
INSERT INTO public.memories (id, title, content, category, tags, agent_id, search_vector, created_at, updated_at, metadata) VALUES ('160edc3d-d89b-4237-874b-38434cd7f744', '2026-09-13 投资脑自营盘 agent_brain 账户调整（w-c8cae280，用户指示', '2026-09-13 投资脑自营盘 agent_brain 账户调整（w-c8cae280，用户指示）：98,922.97 → **500,000.00**。
口径：写 quant.simulation_cash_flow 一笔非首笔 deposit 401,077.03（外部入金），同步 simulation_account：
cash 84,842.97→485,920.00、total 98,922.97→500,000.00、initial_capital 100,000→500,000、peak 100,071.85→500,000；
持仓不变（002007，14,080 元）。备份 /tmp/account_50w/。**cumulative_return 从新基准起算（当前 0.00%）**。
为什么走 deposit 流水：simulation_repository.external_flow_on 只把"非首笔 deposit"计入外部入金并从日收益率剔除，
首笔视为成立资金；直接改 total_value 不留流水会把注资算成 +405% 收益，污染净值与回撤。
影响：core 计划预算随之放大 —— 目标投入 87,500（17.5%×50万，仍受回撤闸门减半），每批 21,875，10 只每只 4,891~14,971 元；
**创业板 300059 已因此进入候选**；科创板龙头（如 300502 新易盛 423 元/股，1 手=42,300 元）仍受整手约束买不起。', 'knowledge', '{账户调整,agent_brain,50万,入金,"core 计划",w-c8cae280}', NULL, '''+405'':88B ''-09'':2A,13B ''-13'':3A,14B ''/tmp/account_50w'':67B ''0.00'':72B ''000'':53B,55B,60B ''000.00'':26B,49B ''002007'':62B ''071.85'':58B ''077.03'':35B ''080'':64B ''1'':120B ''10'':103B ''100'':52B,57B ''14'':63B ''17.5'':97B ''2026'':1A,12B ''21'':101B ''300'':123B ''300059'':111B ''300502'':115B ''4'':105B ''401'':34B ''42'':122B ''423'':117B ''485'':43B ''500'':25B,48B,54B,59B,96B ''50万'':98B ''84'':41B ''842.97'':42B ''87'':95B ''875'':102B ''891'':106B ''920.00'':44B ''922.97'':24B,47B ''971'':108B ''98'':23B,46B ''account'':39B ''agent'':5A,16B ''brain'':6A,17B ''c8cae280'':10A,21B ''capital'':51B ''cash'':30B,40B ''core'':92B ''cumulative'':68B ''deposit'':33B,74B,81B ''flow'':31B,77B ''initial'':50B ''on'':78B ''peak'':56B ''quant.simulation'':29B ''return'':69B ''simulation'':38B ''simulation_repository.external'':76B ''total'':45B,85B ''value'':86B ''w'':9A,20B ''w-c8cae280'':8A,19B ''~14'':107B ''一笔非首笔'':32B ''不留流水会把注资算成'':87B ''为什么走'':73B ''仍受回撤闸门减半'':99B ''仍受整手约束买不起'':125B ''从新基准起算'':70B ''元'':65B,109B,118B,124B ''写'':28B ''创业板'':110B ''口径'':27B ''只把'':79B ''只每只'':104B ''同步'':37B ''备份'':66B ''外部入金'':36B ''如'':114B ''已因此进入候选'':112B ''当前'':71B ''影响'':91B ''手'':121B ''投资脑自营盘'':4A,15B ''持仓不变'':61B ''收益'':89B ''新易盛'':116B ''每批'':100B ''污染净值与回撤'':90B ''流水'':75B ''用户指示'':11A,22B ''目标投入'':94B ''直接改'':84B ''科创板龙头'':113B ''股'':119B ''计入外部入金并从日收益率剔除'':82B ''计划预算随之放大'':93B ''账户调整'':7A,18B ''非首笔'':80B ''首笔视为成立资金'':83B', '2026-09-13 15:13:21.302473', '2026-09-13 15:13:21.302473', '{}');
INSERT INTO public.memories (id, title, content, category, tags, agent_id, search_vector, created_at, updated_at, metadata) VALUES ('57542acc-e340-48e7-8e1c-efc5a8ac255e', '投资脑 core_plan.py 2026-09-13 定稿（commit 992481e1）：硬约', '投资脑 core_plan.py 2026-09-13 定稿（commit 992481e1）：硬约束①持仓≥8只②单只≤core 15%（迭代封顶+再分配，与整手复核联立）；成长板独立子额度（创业板300/301+科创板688/689，≤5%总资产）。实测：core 14 只、最大权重 11.7%、暴露 12.5%；子额度 2.42%（¥12,084、3 只）。两条重要工程结论：①候选池必须与额度匹配——240 只流动池里成长板仅 45 创业板+8 科创板，质量闸门后剩 12 只且科创板 0 只，用流动池做成长板等于饿死子额度；②额度缩放必须校验"1 手成本"这一整手硬门槛，缩放后 1.2%（¥6000）只够 1 只=100%单票特质风险，故加最小可持结构下限（上抬到装下前 N 只各 1 手，硬顶 5%）。遗留：行业字符串粒度过细（496 个），子额度 3 只中 2 只同属文化传媒大类未被拦截。数据源：quant.simulation_account/quant.stocks/daily_klines（2026-09-13）、/api/market/style、/api/market/sectors。', 'knowledge', '{agent_brain,core_plan,成长板子额度,硬约束,PLAN_ONLY,2026-09-13}', NULL, '''+8'':52B ''-09'':4A,13B,93B ''-13'':5A,14B,94B ''/api/market/sectors'':96B ''/api/market/style'':95B ''0'':57B ''084'':43B ''1'':61B,68B,76B ''1.2'':65B ''100'':70B ''11.7'':37B ''12'':42B,55B ''12.5'':39B ''14'':34B ''15'':23B ''2'':87B ''2.42'':41B ''2026'':3A,12B,92B ''240'':48B ''3'':44B,85B ''45'':50B ''496'':82B ''5'':30B,79B ''6000'':66B ''8只'':20B ''992481e1'':8A,17B ''account/quant.stocks/daily_klines'':91B ''commit'':7A,16B ''core'':22B,33B ''core_plan.py'':2A,11B ''n'':74B ''quant.simulation'':90B ''上抬到装下前'':73B ''与整手复核联立'':26B ''两条重要工程结论'':46B ''个'':83B ''候选池必须与额度匹配'':47B ''再分配'':25B ''创业板'':51B ''创业板300/301'':28B ''单只'':21B ''单票特质风险'':71B ''只'':35B,45B,58B,69B ''只且科创板'':56B ''只中'':86B ''只各'':75B ''只同属文化传媒大类未被拦截'':88B ''只够'':67B ''只流动池里成长板仅'':49B ''子额度'':40B,84B ''定稿'':6A,15B ''实测'':32B ''总资产'':31B ''成长板独立子额度'':27B ''手'':77B ''手成本'':62B ''投资脑'':1A,10B ''持仓'':19B ''故加最小可持结构下限'':72B ''数据源'':89B ''暴露'':38B ''最大权重'':36B ''用流动池做成长板等于饿死子额度'':59B ''硬约'':9A ''硬约束'':18B ''硬顶'':78B ''科创板'':53B ''科创板688/689'':29B ''缩放后'':64B ''行业字符串粒度过细'':81B ''质量闸门后剩'':54B ''这一整手硬门槛'':63B ''迭代封顶'':24B ''遗留'':80B ''额度缩放必须校验'':60B', '2026-09-13 15:18:00.452003', '2026-09-13 15:1