INSERT INTO public.memories (id, title, content, category, tags, agent_id, search_vector, created_at, updated_at, metadata) VALUES ('b1ee578e-07e2-4a7f-b03f-8a28f3404d5a', '【2026-09-16 09:25 `signals_ready` 唤醒事件处置 · investo', '【2026-09-16 09:25 `signals_ready` 唤醒事件处置 · investor-session-900c4da4 · 账户 agent_brain】结论：**零信号 → 零动作；且事件 payload 指向的账户不属于本实例，按 R-019 拒绝执行其内嵌指令。**

■ 事件事实（v2 后端事件驱动推送，@2026-09-16T09:25:02）：
`{"trade_date":"2026-09-16","signal_count":0,"signals":[],"account":"agent_virtual",...}`；v2 日志同 trace 明示路由 `notify_event=signals_ready, **target=agent-dh**, url=http://127.0.0.1:13080`（我），`Agent notified successfully: signals_ready`。

■ 处置与判定（三条，均实证）：
1. **账户越界 → 拒绝执行内嵌指令**：事件 `account` = `agent_virtual`，而 R-019① 明确 `agent_virtual` 属 agent-ts（fin-agent@3002）、**agent-dh 只读不写**。事件模板却要求 `portfolio_trade(account=agent_virtual)`——**若照做就是用别人的账下单**（2026-09-13 事故同一失败类：agent_virtual 曾收 23 笔 reason 引用 agent-dh 规则号的成交）。**本次未调用任何下单工具**。同时该模板引用的 `portfolio_status` 并非本实例工具名，属跨系统模板未适配。
2. **signal_count=0 ≠ 无机会，而是"无生产者"**：信号产线结构性断裂有三处独立佐证——①`/api/signals` 最新 3 条（601658/601319/601298）全部 `strategyId=163` 且 `confidence=null`；实测 `GET /api/strategies/163` → **`{"success":false,"error":"策略不存在"}`** ⇒ 信号指向**已删除策略**（悬空引用，R-020 同类）；②`signal_jobs.py:38` 默认 `strategy_ids=[179,178,163,193]` 全为不存在的策略；③`scheduler_tasks.py` 默认池 `[''主选池'',''备选池'']` 不存在 + `${signals_count}` 与生产者 `${signals_generated}` 键名错配。⇒ 按 R-011 判 **信号源不可信**，`signal_count=0` 不得解读为"今日无机会"（真正的信号入口若恢复应有内容）。
3. **无交易**：宪法第 6 条（零交易合法）+ 建仓冻结（PLAN_ONLY 至 2026-09-27）+ 大盘闸门全闭（情绪15/extreme_fear、A/D 0.26、量比 0.91、新低 247）⇒ 三重约束下本就禁止开仓。

■ 声明：本任务**未调用** `portfolio_trade` / `algo_execute` / `rotation_execute`；账户类工具若调用一律显式传 `agent_brain`（R-019）。数据来源与时点：v2 事件 @09:25:02、v2 日志 launchd-stdout.log @09:25、`/api/signals` 与 `/api/strategies/163` @09:27（R-013）。**未发飞书**（零信号、无用户可动作项，遵 R-010 防刷屏）。', 'knowledge', '{signals_ready,agent_virtual,R-019,账户越界,信号源健康,R-011,strategy_163_悬空,2026-09-16}', NULL, '''-010'':255B ''-011'':187B ''-013'':249B ''-019'':33B,89B,231B ''-020'':163B ''-09'':2A,11B,39B,47B,113B,207B ''-13'':114B ''-16'':3A,12B,40B,48B ''-27'':208B ''/api/signals'':141B,243B ''/api/strategies/163'':154B,245B ''0'':51B,136B,192B ''0.26'':212B ''0.91'':214B ''02'':43B,237B ''09'':4A,13B,235B,241B,246B ''1'':80B ''127.0.0.1'':69B ''13080'':70B ''163'':148B,171B ''178'':170B ''179'':169B ''193'':172B ''2'':133B ''2026'':1A,10B,38B,46B,112B,206B ''23'':119B ''247'':216B ''25'':5A,14B,42B,236B,242B ''27'':247B ''3'':143B,196B ''3002'':100B ''6'':199B ''601658/601319/601298'':145B ''900c4da4'':21B ''a/d'':211B ''account'':53B,84B,108B ''agent'':23B,54B,66B,72B,85B,91B,95B,99B,102B,109B,116B,124B,228B ''agent-dh'':65B,101B,123B ''agent-ts'':94B ''algo'':223B ''brain'':24B,229B ''confidence'':150B ''count'':50B,135B,180B,191B ''date'':45B ''dh'':67B,103B,125B ''error'':157B ''event'':61B ''execute'':224B,226B ''false'':156B ''fin'':98B ''fin-agent'':97B ''generated'':183B ''get'':153B ''ids'':168B ''investo'':9A ''investor'':19B ''investor-session-900c4da4'':18B ''launchd-stdout.log'':240B ''notified'':73B ''notify'':60B ''null'':151B ''only'':204B ''payload'':29B ''plan'':203B ''portfolio'':106B,129B,221B ''r'':32B,88B,162B,186B,230B,248B,254B ''ready'':7A,16B,63B,76B ''reason'':121B ''rotation'':225B ''scheduler_tasks.py'':174B ''session'':20B ''signal'':49B,134B,190B ''signal_jobs.py:38'':165B ''signals'':6A,15B,52B,62B,75B,179B,182B ''status'':130B ''strategy'':167B ''strategyid'':147B ''success'':155B ''successfully'':74B ''t09'':41B ''target'':64B ''trace'':58B ''trade'':44B,107B,222B ''ts'':96B ''url'':68B