INSERT INTO public.memories (id, title, content, category, tags, agent_id, search_vector, created_at, updated_at, metadata) VALUES ('4e28b49c-728c-43d0-a73c-6ac5844dd584', '【lifecycle /wake 通道修复 · 2026-09-15 01:5x · REQ-5f8', '【lifecycle /wake 通道修复 · 2026-09-15 01:5x · REQ-5f88fd t1 配置部分】

修复内容（commit 4005f43e，已 ff 合并入 main）：
1) 取消 @pi-investment/lifecycle 注释（cordis.patch.yml:259-260 原被注释禁用）
2) profileDir: ~/.dsh/profiles/investment（09-14 ".dsh-home 并入 .dsh-data" profile 迁移后已成空目录）
   → /Users/yunpeng/pi-investment/agent-dh/.dsh-data/profiles/agent-dh
   依据：lifecycle/src/index.ts 用 join(profileDir,''agents.json'') 与 join(profileDir,''state'')；新路径下两者均存在，且 state/os-outbox.jsonl 至 09-14 16:30 仍在更新（说明该路径才是真身）。
3) 新增 startScript=/Users/yunpeng/pi-investment/agent-dh/scripts/start.sh —— startScript 缺省为 profileDir/start.sh，而新 profileDir 下无该脚本，不配会致自重启失败。

关键工程事实（下次别踩）：
- 真身的源是 $PROJECT_ROOT/config/cordis.yml（start.sh:360-361 的 _ensure_from），**只在目标缺失时拷贝**，--force-config 才覆盖（覆盖前备份）。所以改运行配置必须**同时**改入库源模板，否则将来 --force-config 会把故障带回来。
- 运行真身路径：agent-dh/.dsh-data/profiles/agent-dh/cordis.patch.yml（.dsh-data 被 .gitignore，不入库）。
- launchd 标签 com.pi-investment.dsh（plist: /bin/bash agent-dh/scripts/start.sh 13080）；重启=launchctl kickstart -k gui/$(id -u)/com.pi-investment.dsh。
- 验证通道的命令（安全、不触发投递）：curl -X POST :13080/wake -H ''Content-Type: application/json'' -d ''{}'' —— 若路由存在会返回 400（缺 event）或 401（token 不符）；**返回 405 与不存在路径一致=路由未注册**。

待办：用户选择"只提交、自己重启"。重启并验证 POST /wake 非 405 + 工具列表出现 self_* 后，t1 才算闭环。', 'knowledge', '{lifecycle,/wake,REQ-5f88fd,配置分叉,profileDir}', NULL, '''-09'':5A,16B ''-14'':46B,72B ''-15'':6A,17B ''-260'':40B ''-361'':94B ''/.dsh-data/profiles/agent-dh/cordis.patch.yml'':116B ''/.dsh/profiles/investment'':44B ''/bin/bash'':127B ''/com.pi-investment.dsh'':140B ''/lifecycle'':37B ''/scripts/start.sh'':131B ''/users/yunpeng/pi-investment/agent-dh/.dsh-data/profiles/agent-dh'':56B ''/users/yunpeng/pi-investment/agent-dh/scripts/start.sh'':80B ''/wake'':2A,13B,172B ''01'':7A,18B ''09'':45B,71B ''1'':32B ''13080'':132B ''13080/wake'':147B ''16'':73B ''2'':42B ''2026'':4A,15B ''3'':77B ''30'':74B ''400'':155B ''4005f43e'':27B ''401'':159B ''405'':163B,174B ''5f8'':11A ''5f88fd'':22B ''5x'':8A,19B ''agent'':114B,129B ''agent-dh'':113B,128B ''agents.json'':62B ''application/json'':152B ''com.pi-investment.dsh'':125B ''commit'':26B ''config'':101B,110B ''content'':150B ''content-type'':149B ''cordis.patch.yml:259'':39B ''curl'':144B ''d'':153B ''data'':53B,119B ''dh'':115B,130B ''dsh'':48B,52B,118B ''dsh-data'':51B,117B ''dsh-home'':47B ''ensure'':96B ''event'':157B ''ff'':29B ''force'':100B,109B ''force-config'':99B,108B ''from'':97B ''gitignore'':121B ''gui'':137B ''h'':148B ''home'':49B ''id'':138B ''investment'':36B ''join'':60B,64B ''k'':136B ''kickstart'':135B ''launchctl'':134B ''launchd'':123B ''lifecycle'':1A,12B ''lifecycle/src/index.ts'':58B ''main'':31B ''pi'':35B ''pi-investment'':34B ''plist'':126B ''post'':146B,171B ''profile'':54B ''profiledir'':43B,61B,65B,85B ''profiledir/start.sh'':83B ''project'':91B ''req'':10A,21B ''req-5f8'':9A ''req-5f88fd'':20B ''root/config/cordis.yml'':92B ''self'':176B ''start.sh:360'':93B ''startscript'':79B,81B ''state'':66B ''state/os-outbox.jsonl'':69B ''t1'':23B,178B ''token'':160B ''type'':151B ''u'':139B ''x'':145B ''下无该脚本'':86B ''下次别踩'':89B ''不入库'':122B ''不符'':161B ''不触发投递'':143B ''不配会致自重启失败'':87B ''与'':63B ''与不存在路径一致'':164B ''且'':68B 