3) 挂单时点 2026-09-23 22:26:30（execute_at=market_open、status=pending、reason「测试 submitted_by 字段 - 盘前挂单」、decision_price 1251.24）→ 2026-09-24 09:31:16 撮合 = trade 194（600519 100股@1248.84）；trade 195（600000@8.98）同批。
4) 目的：验证公告板派单 026cd6a3（quant.simulation_order 增加 submitted_by 字段，理由是"多窗口共用 agent_brain 无法归属下单者"），该会话末尾有关闭该提案的动作。

■ 治理结论（优先级高于"超时"）：`run_code` 是唯一能绕过全部交易前置检查的通道——绕过 R-001/R-002（未走 regime_position_limit + risk_controller）、绕过 R-005（reason 校验）、绕过宪法第3条校验（直接造成 600519 占 24.78% 越线），且可在非交易时段落盘前挂单（22:26）使宪法第1条时段约束失效。本周 run_code 12,022 次 = 全部调用的 47%，是最大工具面 + 最大治理盲区。
■ 首要建议：对 run_code/bash 增加下单类端点写护栏（命中 /api/simulation/accounts/*/trade、/api/orders/algo-execute、撤单、熔断减仓等写路径须走 portfolio_trade 或显式人工确认），测试验证改 dry_run 或独立测试账户。原第 1 建议（账户类工具超时 10s→25s，可消除 38/46 次超时）降为第 2。
■ 方法学教训（工具面统计口径）：`run_code` 内部的 shell/curl 调用**不计入 bash 工具计数**（该会话 bash 仅 1 次却实际跑了大量 curl）→ 用工具调用计数评估"谁在做什么"会系统性低估 run_code 的内含动作；定位实际行为必须读会话原文而非只看工具名计数。', 'knowledge', '{周度工具ROI,agent_brain,run_code护栏,成交旁路,R-005,宪法第3条越线,600519,submitted_by,治理盲区}', NULL, '''-001'':168B ''-005'':178B ''-09'':5A,16B,37B,62B,107B,128B ''-21'':6A,17B ''-23'':108B ''-24'':63B,129B ''-27'':38B ''-444'':30B ''/api/orders/algo-execute'':209B ''/api/simulation/accounts'':207B ''/r-002'':169B ''/session-64c01af2-6728-4065-a4a6-8627a0669feb'':58B ''/trade'':208B ''0'':78B ''022'':195B ''026cd6a3'':147B ''09'':130B ''1'':49B,75B,220B,243B ''100股'':137B ''10s'':223B ''12'':194B ''1248.84'':138B ''1251.24'':126B ''127.0.0.1'':86B ''1530'':29B ''16'':64B,132B ''19'':39B ''194'':135B ''195'':140B ''1x'':40B ''2'':42B,73B,80B,229B ''2026'':4A,15B,36B,61B,106B,127B ''22'':65B,109B,188B ''24.78'':185B ''25s'':224B ''26'':110B,189B ''3'':104B ''30'':111B ''31'':131B ''38/46'':226B ''4'':144B ''415'':71B ''418'':67B ''47'':198B ''5001/api/simulation/accounts/agent_brain/trade'':87B ''600'':97B ''600000'':141B ''600519'':136B,183B ''8.98'':142B ''86d2'':33B ''a'':32B ''a-86d2-ffeb9d8c601f'':31B ''action'':94B ''age'':11A ''agent'':22B,56B,156B ''application/json'':92B ''at'':113B ''bash'':74B,238B,241B ''brain'':23B,157B ''buy'':95B ''by'':121B,152B ''code'':70B,102B,164B,193B,233B,250B ''code/bash'':204B ''content'':90B ''content-type'':89B ''controller'':175B ''curl'':82B,245B ''d'':93B ''decision'':124B ''dh'':57B ''dry'':216B ''e349afe9'':28B ''execute'':112B ''ffeb9d8c601f'':34B ''h'':88B ''investment'':55B ''investor'':26B ''investor-session-e349afe9'':25B ''limit'':173B ''market'':114B ''mtime'':60B ''open'':115B ''order'':149B ''pending'':117B ''pi'':54B ''portfolio'':44B,76B,212B ''position'':172B ''post'':85B ''price'':125B ''quant.simulation'':148B ''r'':167B,177B ''read'':72B ''reason'':118B,179B ''regime'':171B ''risk'':174B ''roi'':2A,13B ''run'':69B,101B,163B,192B,203B,217B,232B,249B ''s''