INSERT INTO public.memories (id, title, content, category, tags, agent_id, search_vector, created_at, updated_at, metadata) VALUES ('dbb6541d-a7c1-4b99-b174-5c4115b8c8ea', '【v2 事件·watch_digest（重复推送 + 归属缺陷）处置 · 2026-10-19 11', '【v2 事件·watch_digest（重复推送 + 归属缺陷）处置 · 2026-10-19 11:22 · investor / investor-session-6e6a3382-7efd-4315-b196-15ad0e3152b6】

一、这是**重复事件**：唤醒触发时间 2026-10-19T11:05:44，而我在 11:14–11:15 已把 #2959/#2957/#2954/#2953 四笔触发置 `handled`、并停用规则 238/239/240/241。复验 `GET /api/watch/triggers/unresolved` = **0**，无需再逐条处置。

二、本次唯一增量是**账户归属数据缺陷（linked_account 缺失）**，已修：
- 判定依据：这 4 条 created_by=`opportunity_scan`、created_at=2026-10-12T08:45:41，与定时任务 `agent-brain-candidate-hunt`（cron `0 45 8 * * 1-5`，本实例 agent_brain 的每日候选扫描）批次同签名；同批兄弟规则 226/229/232/237 早已标 `agent_brain`，仅这 4 条漏标 → 判定 **agent_brain**。
- 顺手清理同源噪声 7 条：#248(300418)/#244(300413)/#243(601607) 同为 opportunity_scan → agent_brain；#252(601600) context 明文「user_main_simulation 实际持仓 1000股@9.13」→ user_main_simulation；#256(002027)/#250(000538)/#247(301358) 为 agent 侧候选买入工单、context 无账户字样 → 推定 agent_brain，ops_notes 写明「触发后仍须 R-001/R-008/R-009 重评，规则本身不构成下单授权」。
- 结果：**启用规则 19 条全部有归属（agent_brain 15 / user_main_simulation 4），启用态未归属=0**；153 条总规则中 134 条已停用。

三、根因（代码级，值得回填缺陷单）：`packages/qs_watch/qs_watch/application/services/opportunity_to_watch_rule_service.py::_create_watch_rule()` 调 `rule_repo.create_rule(symbol, conditions, context, expires_at, created_by)` 时**没有传 linked_account/account**，同文件注释自认「扫描建规则时账户尚未归属，硬设会被守卫拒绝」。而 `/api/watch/rules` 的创建接口是**支持** `linked_account`/`account` 的（watch_async.py:104/108）——即能力有、调用方没传。结论：只要自动扫描还跑，无归属规则会持续被生产，每次都被 watch_digest 当数据缺陷推给 agent（本次即重复劳动一整个事件）。

四、另一个观测：这是同一批触发在**事件已闭环后 1 小时内**的重复投递（wake since=2026-10-16T10:55:27，包含已 handled 的 id），说明 digest 的 since 口径没有按 disposition 过滤——建议 digest 只统计 unresolved（与 /triggers/unresolved 对齐），否则「已处置」会被反复重推。

五、无交易：目标 4 只（688099 86.71 / 300750 270.05 / 002460 38.03 / 002709 27.71，tencent realtime 11:14）全部在 MA60 下方 -6.3%/-22.1%/-21.0%/-19.9%，对应规则已按「不接飞刀」停用；账户 agent_brain 现金 48.36 万（96.9%），无仓位压力，符合宪法第 6 条零交易合法。', 'knowledge', '{watch_digest,linked_account,数据缺陷,重复事件,agent_brain,opportunity_scan}', NULL, '''-001'':160B ''-10'':9A,20B,39B,81B,238B ''-12'':82B ''-16'':239B ''-19'':10A,21B,40B ''-19.9'':287B ''-21.0'':286B ''-22.1'':285B ''-5'':97B ''-6.3'':284B ''/108'':216B ''/api/watch/rules'':207B ''/api/watch/triggers/unresolved'':60B ''/r-008/r-009'':161B ''/triggers/unresolved'':259B ''0'':61B,93B,176B ''000538'':144B ''002027'':142B ''002460'':273B ''002709'':275B ''05'':42B ''1'':96B,232B ''1000股'':136B ''11'':11A,22B,45B,47B,279B ''134'':179B ''14'':46B,280B ''15'':48B,170B ''153'':177B ''15ad0e3152b6'':33B ''19'':166B ''2026'':8A,19B,38B,80B,237B ''22'':23B ''226/229/232/237'':104B ''238/239/240/241'':57B ''243'':121B ''244'':119B ''247'':145B ''248'':117B ''250'':143B ''252'':128B ''256'':141B ''27'':242B ''27.71'':276B ''270.05'':272B ''2953'':53B ''2954'':52B ''2957'':51B ''2959'':50B ''300413'':120B ''300418'':118B ''300750'':271B ''301358'':146B ''38.03'':274B ''4'':72B,109B,174B,267B ''41'':85B ''4315'':30B ''44'':43B ''45'':84B,94B ''48.36'':295B ''55'':241B ''6'':300B ''601600'':129B ''601607'':122B ''688099'':269B ''6e6a3382'':28B ''7'':115B ''7efd'':29B ''8'':95B ''86.71'':270B ''9.13'':137B ''96.9'':297B ''account'':67B,211B,212B ''account/account'':202B ''agent'':88B,99B,106B,112B,126B,148B,153B,168B,226B,292B ''agent-brain-candidate-hunt'':87B ''at'':79B,196B ''b196'':32B ''b196-15ad0e3152b6'':31B ''brain'':89B,100B,107B,113B,127B,154B,169B,293B ''by'':75B,198B ''candidate'':90B ''conditions'':193B ''context'':130B,150B,194B ''create'':186B ''created'':74B,78B,197B ''cron'':92B ''digest'':4A,15B,224B,248B,255B ''disposition'':252B ''expires'':195B ''get'':59B ''handled'':55B,244B ''hunt'':91B ''id'':246B ''investor'':24B,26B ''investor-session-6e6a3382-7